Do not use dasshes anywhere in the email "--" absolutely not
A nice hack is to not be stressed about writing full sentences some times. The core body of the email maybe needs to be a sentence. But the top part or closing part doesn't need to be.

Every time you feel like using "--" just think. Cuase usually if you allow yourself to not write a full sentence and just break it to a new line, you never need those dashes.

